# параметр|значение|подпись
NAND_Instance|FMC_NAND_DEVICE|NAND Device
BankMapConfig|FMC_SWAPBMAP_DISABLE|Default mapping
BankMapConfig|FMC_SWAPBMAP_SDRAM_SRAM|NOR/PSRAM bank and SDRAM bank 1/bank2 are swapped
NandCoherentPinout1|MEMORY_WAIT_KO|PINOUT KO
NandCoherentPinout1|MEMORY_PINOUT_OK|PINOUT OK
NandCoherentPinout1|MEMORY_PINOUT_KO|PINOUT KO
NandBank1|FMC_NAND_BANK2|NAND bank 2
NandBank1|FMC_NAND_BANK3|NAND bank 3
NandMemoryDataWidth1|FMC_NAND_MEM_BUS_WIDTH_8|8 bits
NandMemoryDataWidth1|FMC_NAND_MEM_BUS_WIDTH_16|16 bits
EccComputation1|FMC_NAND_ECC_DISABLE|Disabled
EccComputation1|FMC_NAND_ECC_ENABLE|Enabled
ECCPageSize1|FMC_NAND_ECC_PAGE_SIZE_256BYTE|256 bytes
ECCPageSize1|FMC_NAND_ECC_PAGE_SIZE_512BYTE|512 bytes
ECCPageSize1|FMC_NAND_ECC_PAGE_SIZE_1024BYTE|1024 bytes
ECCPageSize1|FMC_NAND_ECC_PAGE_SIZE_2048BYTE|2048 bytes
ECCPageSize1|FMC_NAND_ECC_PAGE_SIZE_4096BYTE|4096 bytes
ECCPageSize1|FMC_NAND_ECC_PAGE_SIZE_8192BYTE|8192 bytes
Waitfeature1|FMC_NAND_WAIT_FEATURE_ENABLE|Enabled
Waitfeature1|FMC_NAND_WAIT_FEATURE_DISABLE|Disabled
